{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人梁杰文於節目中推介哈爾濱電氣(1133)，指公司獲納入恒生綜合指數，有望入選港股通名單，並獲北水追捧。另外，公司早前發盈喜，料中期多賺61%，他認為會有助估值修復。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3323.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026twc2PYTQce1787729229.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁杰文建議現價、約16.22元買入，目標價上望20元，若失守14元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3324.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026POlswKEoUl1787729246.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">哈爾濱電氣(1133)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$16.22</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$20</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$14</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人阮子曦推介紫金礦業(2899)，環球銅及黃金價格持續走強，尤其倫敦期銅逐步迫近歷史高位，對相關股份有利，加上紫金礦業中期業績表現令市場滿意，認為股價有望再挑戰年頭高位。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3325.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20264AA62ZwSaR1787729264.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阮子曦建議現價、38.82元吸納，目標價看45元，止蝕價定於32元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3326.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026UnlMCenJpp1787729275.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紫金礦業(2899)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$38.82</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$45</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$32</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T07:50:36.277748+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}